---
// HomeHero.astro - Hero épuré, visuel et orienté conversion
---

<section class="pt-4 sm:pt-8 pb-12 sm:pb-16 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
    
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center">
      <!-- Eyebrow -->
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-3">
        Calligraphie chinoise · Lyon
      </p>

      <!-- H1 -->
      <h1
        id="hero-title"
        class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-950 dark:text-white leading-[1.14]">
        Découvrez l’art de la calligraphie chinoise
      </h1>

      <!-- Supporting copy -->
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-4 sm:mt-5 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
        Christophe Desmur vous accompagne dans la découverte du pinceau, du geste et des caractères chinois, à travers des ateliers collectifs et des cours individuels.
      </p>

      <!-- CTAs -->
      <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3.5">
        <a
          href="/cours-collectifs"
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 text-white dark:bg-gray-100 dark:text-gray-950 dark:hover:bg-white text-sm font-medium transition text-center shadow-xs focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500">
          Découvrir les cours
        </a>
        <a
          href="/galerie"
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 text-sm font-medium transition text-center focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500">
          Voir les œuvres disponibles
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust line -->
      <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 flex items-center flex-wrap gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-sans">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <span class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Débutants bienvenus</span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600" aria-hidden="true">•</span>
        <span class="font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Enfants & adultes</span>
        <span class="text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600" aria-hidden="true">•</span>
        <span class="font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Lyon</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Image de Christophe en pratique réelle -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative mt-2 lg:mt-0">
      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-lg lg:max-w-none">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm bg-stone-50 dark:bg-gray-800">
          <img
            src="/assets/christophe-desmur-calligraphie-dedicace.webp"
            alt="Christophe Desmur traçant une calligraphie chinoise au pinceau et à l’encre de Chine à Lyon"
            width="1536"
            height="1024"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-full h-auto aspect-4/3 object-cover"
          />
          <div class="py-2.5 px-4 bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-900 text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 flex justify-between items-center font-serif">
            <span>Le geste de l’encre & la tenue du pinceau</span>
            <span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Lyon Croix-Rousse</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
